flowchart LR
  WEB[HTTP / Angular] --> IN[Inbound adapters]
  SCHED[Scheduler / worker] --> IN
  IN --> USE[Application input ports and use cases]
  USE --> DOM[Domain model and policies]
  USE --> OUT[Application-owned output ports]
  OUT --> PGAD[PostgreSQL JDBC adapter]
  OUT --> AIAD[Gemini gateway adapter]
  OUT --> OBS[Logging/clock/job adapters]
  PGAD --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  BOOT[Spring bootstrap/configuration] -. wires .-> IN
  BOOT -. wires .-> USE
  BOOT -. wires .-> PGAD
  BOOT -. wires .-> AIAD
  DOM -. no framework imports .-> DOM
